                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b]This still hasn't been fixed and it still only contains 1/5 of what the store page promises. It is a scam in reality.[/b]\n\n[b]Currently one of the levels is impossible to beat.[/b]\nI have posted about this on the forums and I am waiting for a response but I felt I needed to post this.\nPrevious review:\nIt is a sliding puzzle game like a '15 puzzle' but a few of the later levels change things a bit and hopefully once they are out, the other levels will add interesting mechanics.\nIt seems like it will be a nice relaxing game but currently there isn't much here and a few things are lacking. There is no way to change the level or to quit the game without using alt+f4.\nDue to a glitch I saw some later levels and they did change things a bit. It should have been released as early access in its current form or it shouldn't have been released yet since only 1 episode of 5 is actually available to play atm and there are a few things that need to be ironed out.\n\nI love minimalist puzzle games so I am hoping this game will end up a good one since it does show promise.\nBut in its current form, I can not recommend this game.\n\nEdit:\nI sent a refund request for it. I'll rebuy if the game ever gets fixed and the levels that were promised are added. It should have been put in early access.",
